# Mobile (Capacitor) build env — loaded by `vite build --mode mobile`.
# Separate from .env so local web `pnpm dev` keeps hitting localhost untouched.
#
# 10.0.2.2 is the Android emulator's alias for the host machine's loopback, so
# this reaches a local `apps/api` running on the host at :4000. Use a real HTTPS
# URL here once a deployed API exists (and drop CAP_ENV=dev so the build goes
# back to androidScheme=https — see capacitor.config.ts).
VITE_API_URL=http://10.0.2.2:4000
